quiet.md #7: ListState::estimated_scroll_metrics / scroll_to_estimated_offset

Only rows that have been on screen are measured. For a scrollbar, count every
other row at the average measured height: estimated_scroll_metrics returns
(offset, content height, viewport height), and scroll_to_estimated_offset
scrolls to such an offset when the thumb is dragged. Long documents get a
usable scrollbar.

